[{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l035","ordinal":307969,"en":"To take revenge upon Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l036","ordinal":307970,"en":"To make a glorious slaughter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l037","ordinal":307971,"en":"Pour blood into the dark waters,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l038","ordinal":307972,"en":"Set the riverlands ablaze,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l039","ordinal":307973,"en":"Begin carnage on the open plain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0167:b003:l040","ordinal":307974,"en":"And raise a feud to destroy the foe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l001","ordinal":307975,"en":"One hair of his mustache resembled"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l002","ordinal":307976,"en":"The handle of a greasy axe;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l003","ordinal":307977,"en":"His great nose resembled a saber’s sheath."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l004","ordinal":307978,"en":"The ill-fated Choro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l005","ordinal":307979,"en":"Readied himself like a tiger,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l006","ordinal":307980,"en":"And none who challenged him would survive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l007","ordinal":307981,"en":"He grasped his bow and prepared,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l008","ordinal":307982,"en":"Appealing to the spirits"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l009","ordinal":307983,"en":"Of the gray wolves Almambet and Manas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l010","ordinal":307984,"en":"And drew the bow without tiring."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l011","ordinal":307985,"en":"The vigor of the crackling warrior,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l012","ordinal":307986,"en":"His swiftness, was beyond measure;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l013","ordinal":307987,"en":"Choro shot at the mattocks…"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l014","ordinal":307988,"en":"Through all ninety mattocks in a row"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l015","ordinal":307989,"en":"The arrow passed without stopping;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l016","ordinal":307990,"en":"After piercing the mattocks, the arrow"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l017","ordinal":307991,"en":"Plunged into the ground beyond them."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l018","ordinal":307992,"en":"Seeing this, Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l019","ordinal":307993,"en":"Quickly cried, “Baabedin!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l020","ordinal":307994,"en":"And swiftly vowed a moon-hoofed horse"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l021","ordinal":307995,"en":"In honor of his princely father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l022","ordinal":307996,"en":"Rejoicing so greatly that Choro cried:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l023","ordinal":307997,"en":"“Long ago, when we were young boys,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l024","ordinal":307998,"en":"When we were drunk and sated with liquor,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l025","ordinal":307999,"en":"In the marshlands of Jylgynduu,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l026","ordinal":308000,"en":"While the Kyrgyz lived in joy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l027","ordinal":308001,"en":"If bored, we would shoot antelope;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l028","ordinal":308002,"en":"If not, in Talas"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l029","ordinal":308003,"en":"We would play at ease."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l030","ordinal":308004,"en":"When we camped high in the passes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l031","ordinal":308005,"en":"And ranged along the mountains,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l032","ordinal":308006,"en":"With games by day and girls by night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l033","ordinal":308007,"en":"Such were those days."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l034","ordinal":308008,"en":"We routed foes and took plunder,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l035","ordinal":308009,"en":"Defeated hosts of countless myriads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l036","ordinal":308010,"en":"And won spoils from the lions we sought;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l037","ordinal":308011,"en":"Such were those days,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l038","ordinal":308012,"en":"When our fortune was whole"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l039","ordinal":308013,"en":"And my gray-wolf uncle lived."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b002:l040","ordinal":308014,"en":"He was a vigorous, fleet-footed hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l001","ordinal":308015,"en":"Tall and broad-shouldered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l002","ordinal":308016,"en":"Both wrestler and lion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l003","ordinal":308017,"en":"When roused, that poor hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l004","ordinal":308018,"en":"Would subdue the world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l005","ordinal":308019,"en":"His figure was like a plane tree,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l006","ordinal":308020,"en":"His charge swift as a falcon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l007","ordinal":308021,"en":"His courage like the wind of the world;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l008","ordinal":308022,"en":"When he charged, he seemed to devour lives."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l009","ordinal":308023,"en":"When Choro surged in wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l010","ordinal":308024,"en":"No mountain could withstand him;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l011","ordinal":308025,"en":"He charged without loosening his ranks,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l012","ordinal":308026,"en":"And none across the world could defeat him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l013","ordinal":308027,"en":"A wise servant descended from heroes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l014","ordinal":308028,"en":"A grappler surpassing the world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l015","ordinal":308029,"en":"He prepared to draw the bow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l016","ordinal":308030,"en":"Donned his coat of mail, gleaming,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l017","ordinal":308031,"en":"His moonlike face shining,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l018","ordinal":308032,"en":"And girded on his gray belt."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l019","ordinal":308033,"en":"He gave a deep rumbling cry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l020","ordinal":308034,"en":"Took the steel bow in his hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l021","ordinal":308035,"en":"And fixed his gaze upon the mattocks."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l022","ordinal":308036,"en":"His back bent and hunched,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l023","ordinal":308037,"en":"His eyes bulged and clouded;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l024","ordinal":308038,"en":"Fat oozed from his thumb,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l025","ordinal":308039,"en":"And from Choro’s forearm"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l026","ordinal":308040,"en":"Dark blood dripped."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l027","ordinal":308041,"en":"He labored with fierce resolve,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l028","ordinal":308042,"en":"Clenched his teeth and gathered his strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l029","ordinal":308043,"en":"Until the bones of his spine crackled."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l030","ordinal":308044,"en":"Driven mad by wounded pride,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l031","ordinal":308045,"en":"“Will he die a wretched death?” they wondered;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l032","ordinal":308046,"en":"The people cried out in tumult"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l033","ordinal":308047,"en":"And stood crowded round, watching."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l034","ordinal":308048,"en":"“How will he shoot the mattocks?” they asked;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l035","ordinal":308049,"en":"The people stood crowded round,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l036","ordinal":308050,"en":"Marveling at Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l037","ordinal":308051,"en":"The poor man favored by the spirits"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l038","ordinal":308052,"en":"Revealed himself to be a lion;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l039","ordinal":308053,"en":"His waist bent like a racing hound’s,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0168:b003:l040","ordinal":308054,"en":"One hair of his mustache—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l001","ordinal":308055,"en":"A periodic source of power,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l002","ordinal":308056,"en":"As I have seen many times,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l003","ordinal":308057,"en":"I want to mature,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l004","ordinal":308058,"en":"I'm full of blue ticks,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l005","ordinal":308059,"en":"It seems that I am stalking -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l006","ordinal":308060,"en":"Probably for a century,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l007","ordinal":308061,"en":"Urum would stand for a century,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l008","ordinal":308062,"en":"It was time for me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l009","ordinal":308063,"en":"God granted my wish."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l010","ordinal":308064,"en":"A hundred times more than before"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l011","ordinal":308065,"en":"I guess I'm full of strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l012","ordinal":308066,"en":"Kanchoro, probably two unclean ones"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l013","ordinal":308067,"en":"They wanted revenge."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l014","ordinal":308068,"en":"Now I'll take you with a wide hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l015","ordinal":308069,"en":"From slaves who want to come"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l016","ordinal":308070,"en":"I will take my revenge later."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l017","ordinal":308071,"en":"Now I will move from Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l018","ordinal":308072,"en":"From distraught slaves"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l019","ordinal":308073,"en":"I can argue my revenge."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l020","ordinal":308074,"en":"Six months left in the womb"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l021","ordinal":308075,"en":"I was an orphan,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l022","ordinal":308076,"en":"The desolation that made Karala,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l023","ordinal":308077,"en":"If I put it under me, I'm lucky."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l024","ordinal":308078,"en":"If I'm driving, I'm fine."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l025","ordinal":308079,"en":"My nightingale is more expensive than a ton,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l026","ordinal":308080,"en":"My dearly departed servant."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l027","ordinal":308081,"en":"My servant is from your moon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l028","ordinal":308082,"en":"I didn't see Eminem."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l029","ordinal":308083,"en":"I didn't get into trouble."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l030","ordinal":308084,"en":"I didn't drink anything."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l031","ordinal":308085,"en":"My evening is a fire,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l032","ordinal":308086,"en":"I ate in lumps,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l033","ordinal":308087,"en":"My love is from your moon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l034","ordinal":308088,"en":"I got off the horse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l035","ordinal":308089,"en":"I have fun in my hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l036","ordinal":308090,"en":"Hey, my son, I was born today."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l037","ordinal":308091,"en":"It came full of excitement,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l038","ordinal":308092,"en":"Back to your head"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l039","ordinal":308093,"en":"How much power has come,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b002:l040","ordinal":308094,"en":"The night has passed and the day has come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b003:l001","ordinal":308095,"en":"While testing his strength."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b003:l002","ordinal":308096,"en":"Argyn, mixed Kyrgyz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b003:l003","ordinal":308097,"en":"When testing his strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b003:l004","ordinal":308098,"en":"A lump on the forehead"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0169:b003:l005","ordinal":308099,"en":"When not shooting,"},{"id":"seyte