,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l015","ordinal":308149,"en":"Fat lungs, brass wrists,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l016","ordinal":308150,"en":"He wanted a horse from a horse,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l017","ordinal":308151,"en":"Elected at random,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l018","ordinal":308152,"en":"A sword, a sword, an eagle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l019","ordinal":308153,"en":"Having prepared all this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l020","ordinal":308154,"en":"Seven-Owned"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l021","ordinal":308155,"en":"At least to massacre,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l022","ordinal":308156,"en":"And the blue of the world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l023","ordinal":308157,"en":"To take revenge."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l024","ordinal":308158,"en":"Jobolodoo Choron"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l025","ordinal":308159,"en":"Semetey was lost"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l026","ordinal":308160,"en":"Joolashari - no Kiyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l027","ordinal":308161,"en":"The one who flew is Semetey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l028","ordinal":308162,"en":"The fight is Kanchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l029","ordinal":308163,"en":"How beautiful lies"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l030","ordinal":308164,"en":"The summer of Kagish is humble,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l031","ordinal":308165,"en":"Seitek, a man who was swept away."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l032","ordinal":308166,"en":"Semergeni Külchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l033","ordinal":308167,"en":"Treat with oil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l034","ordinal":308168,"en":"It was like the beginning"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l035","ordinal":308169,"en":"Külchoro, your beautiful flower"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l036","ordinal":308170,"en":"It was full of blue ticks."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l037","ordinal":308171,"en":"This is Külchoro blue sky"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0170:b002:l038","ordinal"